      "file": "src/main/runtime/runtime-mobile-speech-catalog.ts",
      "read": "full",
      "behavior": "list projects all12 catalog rows with provider/size/recommended/status/progress and current settings; missing state falls back not-downloaded. download rejects unknown/nonlocal, returns started true immediately and logs later failure. configure allows empty modelId, rejects unknown nonempty, merges voice fields and notifies; no download/readiness check here. delete delegates protected cleanup and returns refreshed list; internals not traced. Writable-store guards for configure/delete."
    },
